    "name": "I'm No Demonlord",
    "steam_appid": 3258560,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/bc6c91b6e6c73ad07f8526a10416d061.avif?t=1747674610\" width=614 height=168 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss the latest updates on [Discord / YouTube / X]!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow and add us\u2014we\u2019re waiting for you! Check out the community information on the right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/03a2d9b5282dfa478ef888dfd75a92c1.avif?t=1747674610\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, a legendary archmage sacrificed himself to cast a magical seal on a supervillain, allowing the kingdom to prosper. But when the king began arresting commoners without reason, the vanished people were never seen again. One day, the seal weakened, the demon king escaped, and possessed the player's adventurer character. Can he accept his new identity? Uncover the king's plot? Save &quot;kinds&quot; or destroy &quot;outsiders&quot;? Good or evil? It's your choice...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/097117f317dca5f0eae6999cdf9e6730.avif?t=1747674610\" width=614 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Round up your friends for an adventure! The game currently supports both remote play and local co-op for two players. So, grab your buddy and join the adventure together! The mysterious plot awaits your discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/342aa55ad2c6693133bbc8436d46dd61.poster.avif?t=1747674610\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/342aa55ad2c6693133bbc8436d46dd61.webm?t=1747674610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/342aa55ad2c6693133bbc8436d46dd61.mp4?t=1747674610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/019f687f70882fb985241fa82a708f88.avif?t=1747674610\" width=614 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1000 construction mechanics, endless combinations. Say no to pure numerical growth experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players freely combine factions, with mechanisms interacting to create wondrous chemical reactions, ensuring no two playthroughs are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/4b319665b835d528f76c685a32e18258.poster.avif?t=1747674610\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/4b319665b835d528f76c685a32e18258.webm?t=1747674610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/4b319665b835d528f76c685a32e18258.mp4?t=1747674610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/d13a9ab965c83e0208f3b2cbf5578a48.avif?t=1747674610\" width=614 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely choose route branches based on their own needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure rooms, challenge rooms, and rare abilities await your discovery, making your build even more powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/691337e49b3bd062679ec385aa0e9efe.poster.avif?t=1747674610\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/691337e49b3bd062679ec385aa0e9efe.webm?t=1747674610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/691337e49b3bd062679ec385aa0e9efe.mp4?t=1747674610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss the latest updates on [Discord / YouTube / X]!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow and add us\u2014we\u2019re waiting for you! Check out the community information on the right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/03a2d9b5282dfa478ef888dfd75a92c1.avif?t=1747674610\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, a legendary archmage sacrificed himself to cast a magical seal on a supervillain, allowing the kingdom to prosper. But when the king began arresting commoners without reason, the vanished people were never seen again. One day, the seal weakened, the demon king escaped, and possessed the player's adventurer character. Can he accept his new identity? Uncover the king's plot? Save &quot;kinds&quot; or destroy &quot;outsiders&quot;? Good or evil? It's your choice...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/097117f317dca5f0eae6999cdf9e6730.avif?t=1747674610\" width=614 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Round up your friends for an adventure! The game currently supports both remote play and local co-op for two players. So, grab your buddy and join the adventure together! The mysterious plot awaits your discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/342aa55ad2c6693133bbc8436d46dd61.poster.avif?t=1747674610\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/342aa55ad2c6693133bbc8436d46dd61.webm?t=1747674610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/342aa55ad2c6693133bbc8436d46dd61.mp4?t=1747674610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/019f687f70882fb985241fa82a708f88.avif?t=1747674610\" width=614 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1000 construction mechanics, endless combinations. Say no to pure numerical growth experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players freely combine factions, with mechanisms interacting to create wondrous chemical reactions, ensuring no two playthroughs are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/4b319665b835d528f76c685a32e18258.poster.avif?t=1747674610\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/4b319665b835d528f76c685a32e18258.webm?t=1747674610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/4b319665b835d528f76c685a32e18258.mp4?t=1747674610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/d13a9ab965c83e0208f3b2cbf5578a48.avif?t=1747674610\" width=614 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely choose route branches based on their own needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure rooms, challenge rooms, and rare abilities await your discovery, making your build even more powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/691337e49b3bd062679ec385aa0e9efe.poster.avif?t=1747674610\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/691337e49b3bd062679ec385aa0e9efe.webm?t=1747674610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/691337e49b3bd062679ec385aa0e9efe.mp4?t=1747674610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;I'm No Demonlord&quot; is a Roguelike shooter bullet hell game. High freedom in mechanics leads to unique playthroughs. As a demon-possessed hero, battle enemies, grow, and unveil dark schemes. Can he accept his new role? Save &quot;kinds&quot; or destroy &quot;outsiders&quot;? Good or evil? The choice is yours.",
